1. Core types

1.1 ManifoldState

Represents the global simulation state.

Fields:

x: spacetime coordinates[ x^\mu ]

p: canonical momenta[ p_\mu ]

theta: warp/control parameters

sigma: encrypted metadata and identifiers

2. Hamiltonian Manifold Engine (HME)

2.1 HamiltonianEngine

Purpose: Core Hamiltonian solver on curved spacetime.

Methods:

compute_hamiltonian(state: ManifoldState) -> floatDescription: Evaluates[ H(x, p; \theta) = \frac{1}{2} g^{\mu\nu}(x; \theta)p_\mu p_\nu + V_{\text{warp}}(\theta) ]

step(state: ManifoldState, dt: float) -> ManifoldStateDescription: Advances state using: [ \dot{x}^\mu = \frac{\partial H}{\partial p_\mu}, \quad \dot{p}_\mu = -\frac{\partial H}{\partial x^\mu} ]

set_metric(metric: MetricField)Description: Assigns (g_{\mu\nu}(x; \theta)) and (g^{\mu\nu}(x; \theta)).

compute_lyapunov(state: ManifoldState, perturbation: ManifoldState, t_max: float) -> floatDescription: Returns Lyapunov exponent: [ \lambda = \lim_{t \to \infty} \frac{1}{t} \ln \frac{|\delta x(t)|}{|\delta x(0)|} ]

3. Warp‑Metric Module

3.1 WarpMetric

Purpose: Defines and manages warp‑bubble spacetime geometry.

Methods:

evaluate_metric(x: Vector, theta: WarpParams) -> MetricTensorDescription: Returns (g_{\mu\nu}) for given coordinates and parameters.

evaluate_inverse_metric(x: Vector, theta: WarpParams) -> MetricTensorDescription: Returns (g^{\mu\nu}).

set_bubble_profile(f: Callable)Description: Sets shaping function (f(r_s)).

set_velocity_profile(vs: Callable)Description: Sets bubble velocity (v_s(t)).

compute_curvature(x: Vector, theta: WarpParams) -> CurvatureInvariantsDescription: Returns curvature scalars for volatility mapping.

4. Galactica‑Terminus Data Pipeline (GTDP)

4.1 AstroDataIngestor

Purpose: Maps astrophysical data into manifold fields.

Methods:

load_dataset(path: str) -> AstroDatasetDescription: Loads astrophysical data (mass, positions, etc.).

compute_stress_energy(dataset: AstroDataset) -> StressEnergyTensorFieldDescription: Builds (T_{\mu\nu}).

update_metric_from_data(metric: WarpMetric, T: StressEnergyTensorField) -> MetricFieldDescription: Approximates: [ G_{\mu\nu} = 8\pi G,T_{\mu\nu} ]

tag_metadata(dataset: AstroDataset) -> IVOAMetadataDescription: Generates IVOA‑compliant tags.

4.2 DigitalTwinManager

Purpose: Maintains spacetime digital twin.

Methods:

sync_state(state: ManifoldState, dataset: AstroDataset) -> ManifoldStateDescription: Aligns simulation with latest astrophysical data.

snapshot(state: ManifoldState) -> TwinSnapshotDescription: Stores a versioned twin state.

compare_to_observation(snapshot: TwinSnapshot, dataset: AstroDataset) -> ErrorMetricsDescription: Computes fidelity metrics.

5. Dual‑Layer Encryption Protocol (DLEP)

5.1 SignatureManager

Purpose: Hashing and identifier binding.

Methods:

hash_state(state: ManifoldState) -> HashDigestDescription: Computes SHA‑3512 hash.

generate_ivoa_id(state: ManifoldState, digest: HashDigest) -> IVOAIdentifierDescription: Binds state to an IVOA identifier.

5.2 EncryptionManager

Purpose: Manifold state encryption.

Methods:

encrypt_state(state: ManifoldState, mode: EncryptionMode) -> EncryptedStateDescription: Applies cylindrical or rock‑layer encryption.

decrypt_state(enc_state: EncryptedState) -> ManifoldStateDescription: Recovers plaintext state.

homomorphic_step(enc_state: EncryptedState, dt: float) -> EncryptedStateDescription: Computes: [ \text{Enc}(\mathbf{z}{t+1}) = \mathcal{F}{\text{hom}}(\text{Enc}(\mathbf{z}_t)) ]

5.3 TransportLayer

Purpose: Secure communication.

Methods:

open_secure_channel(endpoint: str) -> TLSChannelDescription: Opens TLS 1.3 channel.

send_encrypted_state(channel: TLSChannel, enc_state: EncryptedState)Description: Transmits encrypted manifold state.

receive_encrypted_state(channel: TLSChannel) -> EncryptedStateDescription: Receives encrypted state.

6. Simulation Orchestrator

6.1 SimulationRunner

Purpose: High‑level control of full spacetime simulation.

Methods:

initialize(manifold: WarpMetric, engine: HamiltonianEngine, data: AstroDataIngestor, enc: EncryptionManager) -> NoneDescription: Wires core modules together.

run_step(state: ManifoldState, dt: float) -> ManifoldStateDescription: Executes one full simulation step (physics + data + encryption).

run_encrypted_step(enc_state: EncryptedState, dt: float) -> EncryptedStateDescription: Same as above, fully homomorphic.

evaluate_stability(state: ManifoldState) -> StabilityReportDescription: Aggregates Lyapunov, curvature, and volatility metrics.

export_snapshot(state: ManifoldState, format: SnapshotFormat) -> SnapshotArtifactDescription: Produces a saved artifact (for analysis or publication).

